# CFIRE-UPSTREAM: CF-031, CF-146
# The remote vault client's HTTP shim (milestone 43): libcurl, for TLS, timeouts and
# request and response headers that core:net/http does not give cfire code (CF-146).
# Apart from flint-native so flint-vault-server never links libcurl.
Name: flint-remote
Description: Native HTTP shim for Flint's remote vault client
Version: 1
Requires: libcurl
Cflags: -I${pcfiledir}/../../vaultremote/native
